%% The dispatcher already ran. The gate compares that result to constants.
sequenceDiagram
  participant Disp as IngestDispatcher
  participant Gate as HopGate
  participant Notify as AgentNotifier
  participant Svc as IncidentService
  participant Writer as IncidentWriter
  participant DB as ReportStore
  participant LF as LangfuseExporter

  Disp->>Gate: one accept result, or one drop, or the queue depth
  Gate->>Gate: compare with IngressTriggers
  Note over Gate: rising edge only. Still hot does not fire again.
  Gate->>Notify: snapshot
  Notify->>Svc: POST /api/incidents
  Svc->>Writer: writeReport(snapshot)
  Writer-->>Svc: report body
  Svc->>DB: insert report and first assistant message
  Svc->>LF: export agent and generation spans
  Note over LF,DB: a failed export does not delete the report
